    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wendeleyaga ku'yomba ati', “Ku'nguno yeni'yo Bezaleli na Oholiabu, haki'mo na ki'la fundi u'yo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuyali'laga wu'manyi na masala ga ki'tu'mami'le cha mili'mo zyose ku' wu'zyengi wa hantu' hasondo, aku'tu'mama ku'gelani'la na gose ago Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wav'itanaga Bezaleli na Oholiabu, na ki'la fundi u'yo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamupaga wu'manyi na wu'togwe wa kwiza ku'tu'mama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'enav'o v'apokelaga kalu'mbi'lo ku'fuma ku'mwa Mose ako kafumiv'agwa na V'aizilaeli ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa hantu' hasondo. V'antu' v'endeleyaga ku'muletela kalu'mbi'lo kav'o ku' wu'togwe wav'o ki'la ndiyu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi lyafikaga itungo v'antu' v'ose v'a wu'manyi av'o ndi' v'ali'tu'mama mili'mo zya ki'la mukoli zya ku'zyenga hantu' hasondo v'i'mi'kyaga mili'mo na ku'ya ku'mwa Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nav'o v'amuwi'laga ati', “V'antu' v'ali'leta vintu' vingi muno ku'ki'la i'vyo vili'koov'iwa ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwenu'gu' u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye gu'v'ezyeke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wafumyaga ilagi'li'zyo, nav'o v'afilaga mmola mu nkambi' yose, ati', “Ki'la muntu', av'e mugosya ninga muki'ma, ku'du' alete hangi' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo ka hantu' hasondo.” Hohene v'antu' v'ahangagwa ku'leta vintu', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku'nguno i'vyo ndi' v'aletaga ndi' vyagelani'laga ku' muli'mo gwenu'go mpaka na ku'sigali'la.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'zyenga Ihema Isondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'antu' v'ose av'o v'ali' na wu'manyi v'av'ezyaga Ihema Isondo ku' miki'ngo iku'mi zya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na zya wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyatyanagwa ku' wu'tonto ku' kolwa masu'mbano ga v'akelubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la muki'ngo gwav'age na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na iv'i'li' na wu'gali'nhu wago mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyose zyav'age zya ki'pimo ki'mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'azilu'ngyaga ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ku'v'a muki'ngo gu'mo, na miki'ngo zingi' itano ku'v'a muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'asumi'laga ngovyo zya langi ya bululu ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa kwandya, na vyene vivyo v'asumi'laga ngovyo zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li', nazyo ngovyo zyose zilingaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'av'ezyaga visikizo maku'mi atano vya zahabu, i'vyo vyalu'ngi'zyaga i'zyo miki'ngo iv'i'li', nazyo zyav'aga ki'ntu' ki'mo ku'nguno ya ihema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga nfundi' ya ihema ku' miki'ngo iku'mi na gu'mo zya wu'yenze wa mbu'li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la muki'ngo gwav'age na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na idatu', na wu'gali'nhu mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyose iku'mi na gu'mo zyav'age na ki'pimo ki'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'azilu'ngyaga ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ku'v'a muki'ngo gu'mo, na i'zyo miki'ngo zingi' mukaga ku'v'a muki'ngo gu'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'av'ezyaga ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga visikizo maku'mi atano vya shaba na ku'vingi'zya mu i'zyo ngovyo, ki'gele ku'yi'lu'ngya nfundi' ya ihema yi'v'e ki'ntu' ki'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga nfundi' ya ihema ku' ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa, na ha igu'lya yayo v'av'ezyaga nfundi' yi'ngi' ya ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'av'ezyaga felemu ku'tu'mi'la mbawo zya mugu'nga zya ku'ki'ndi'ki'la ihema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la felemu yav'age na mbawo iv'i'li' zya wu'lihu wa mita ine na wu'gali'nhu wa maba sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la lu'bawo lwav'age na lu'li'mi lu'mo lwa ku'sopeka ku' kikali'lo. Felemu zyose zya ihema v'aziv'ezezyaga ndi'mi iv'i'li' iv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga felemu maku'mi av'i'li' ku' lwandi' lwa dakama lwa ihema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na vikali'lo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza vya ku'tu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na zyeni'zyo felemu maku'mi av'i'li'. Ki'la felemu yav'age na vikali'lo viv'i'li', ki'gele zidimi'li'le i'zyo ndi'mi zyayo iv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'av'ezyaga felemu zingi' maku'mi av'i'li' ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa sukuma lwa ihema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na vikali'lo vyazyo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza. Ki'la felemu yav'age na vikali'lo viv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.26"
            ]
          }
